For 4.4 focus/active:
- Concept: activation = OS-level focus; per-window cached in gpui Window `Rc<Cell<bool>>` initialized at Window::new from platform_window.is_active() (1422), updated by platform callback on_active_status_change (1710-1730) which also refreshes modifiers, fires activation_observers, bounds_changed, refresh.
- Platform side: X11 tracks `state.active` from _NET_WM_STATE_FOCUSED atom scan (1116-1135) and is_active reads it (1543-1545); set_active triggers callback (1322-1331). Windows is_active compares hwnd with GetActiveWindow() (858-860). Wayland is_active reads state.active (1590-1592).
- App-level: Window::is_window_active (2510-2512).
- window_stack: Platform::window_stack default None (platform.rs:142-144); macOS MacWindow::ordered_windows (macos platform.rs:645-647); X11 reads root's _NET_CLIENT_LIST_STACKING property (x11/client.rs:1817-1839); Wayland returns None (wayland/client.rs:1219-1221) — protocol doesn't expose global stacking. active_window required method (platform.rs:141); X11 from keyboard_focused_window (x11/client.rs:1807-1815); Wayland likewise (wayland/client.rs:1211-1217).
- Conclusion: 激活状态由两层共同维护：平台窗口是事实来源（source of truth），gpui Window 只是缓存镜像；window_stack 只能问平台要，因为 Z 序是全局信息，单个窗口看不见。App 层通过 cx.window_stack() (app.rs:1236) 转发.

